  "description": "BarcodeLib.Ocr is a C# library for Optical Character Recognition to read, extract text contents from raster images, scanned PDFs, multi-page TIFF image files in .NET projects.\n\nBarcodeLib.Ocr is an advanced OCR SDK library:\n * BarcodeLib OCR C# library has led the industry in optical character recognition\n * Allow characters recognition and extraction from images captured by digital camera, scanned PDF document and image-only PDF\n * Support multiple languages, including English, German, Japanese, French, Portuguese, Spanish, Russian, Italian, Dutch, Arabic, etc\n * Support user-defined image and document OCR, like full-page, partial page, auto and manual zonal OCR recognition\n * Able to read QR Code, Code 128 and other 20+ barcode data message from image, tiff, pdf files\n\nCompatible with\n* .NET Standard 2.0\n* .NET 8, .NET 7, .NET 6, .NET 5, .NET Core 3.x & 2.x\n* .NET Framework 4.x\n\nSupport\n* Email : support@barcodelib.com",
